 "stimulus_html": "For questions 2 – 3, use the following information :\n<blockquote>\n<p>The graph shows the yearly balance, in dollars, of investment account A. The table shows the yearly balance, in dollars, of investment account B.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Investment account A</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Investment account B</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"Graph of a function on grid.\" src=\"exercises/media/8f571ad4cdffef88.svg\">\n</td>\n<td><table class=\"os-raise-skinnytable unnumbered\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Number of years</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Amount in dollars</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>0</td>\n          <td>$2,000</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1</td>\n          <td>$2,150</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>2</td>\n          <td>$2,300</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>3</td>\n          <td>$2,450</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>$2,600</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</blockquote>",
